# Operator-supplied audio never enters the repository.
#
# These are somebody else's recordings as often as not, and a file dropped in
# here to make one league's draft night sound right has no business being
# redistributed with the project. The presentation ships a full set of
# generated cues, so nothing here is required for it to work.
intro.*
draft-bed.*
pick-is-in.*
on-the-clock.*
countdown.*
transition.*
draft-complete.*
